From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:05:49 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 24/25] contrib: gtactive3wifi: kernel: Exynos ADC and ADC
 thermal zones

They were only in the bring-up config, and gen-kernel-config starts from
the last built bring-up .config, which predates them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/kernel/gtactive3wifi.config | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/kernel/gtactive3wifi.config b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/kernel/gtactive3wifi.config
index 12cc3f2..d60d0e8 100644
--- a/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/kernel/gtactive3wifi.config
+++ b/contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/kernel/gtactive3wifi.config
@@ -301,3 +301,8 @@ CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_THERMAL=y
 # Landlock is in CONFIG_LSM already but was not built (flatpak, podman,
 # systemd sandboxing use it)
 CONFIG_SECURITY_LANDLOCK=y
+
+# AP ADC and the battery / charger / USB NTC thermal zones (battery
+# temperature-limited charging; src/linux drv/battemp-stage1)
+CONFIG_EXYNOS_ADC=m
+CONFIG_GENERIC_ADC_THERMAL=m
